# inputs) and where the built-in state variables and the uniforms are in the
# constant buffers, when PGPU_VC4_DUMP is set; gl_FragCoord at the pixel centre;
# a switch for the lower left point sprite origin (PGPU_POINT_LOWER_LEFT).
# For Mesa mesa-26.2.3; applied by tools/glslc/build-mesa.sh.

